  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safer Schools for Girls (SS4G) in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SS4G project address school related GBV for primary school girls in Koinadugu district. A multi-level approach focusing at individual, school, community and institutional levels building girls agency in understanding the provisions of law, their SRHR and support initiatives that support them also using Champions of Change model.</narrative>
  </description>
